## Interface: 16001
## Title: Quartermaster
## Notes: A profession companion. Works out the cheapest way to any profession goal (a skill level, a recipe, a gear upgrade) from your bags, bank, vendors, trainers and auction prices, and shows the steps beside your profession window. /qm shows or hides the plan.
## Version: 1.0.3
## Category: Professions
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Scroll_03
## SavedVariables: QuartermasterDB
## Dependencies: Auctionator, Questie, QuestieDB
## OptionalDeps: TomTom
